Bu repozitoriya SIMMED loyihasining ko'rgazma (code sample) nusxasi bo'lib,
President AI Award tanlovi doirasida baholash uchun ochiq qilingan.

Kodni ko'rish va o'rganishga ruxsat beriladi. Muallifning yozma roziligisiz
kodni nusxalash, o'zgartirish, tarqatish yoki tijoriy maqsadda ishlatish
taqiqlanadi. Loyiha DGU davlat guvohnomasi bilan ro'yxatdan o'tkazilgan.

---

This repository is a curated code sample of the SIMMED project, published for
evaluation within the President AI Award competition.

Viewing and study are permitted. Copying, modification, redistribution, or
commercial use without the author's written permission is prohibited. The
project is registered with a state certificate (DGU).
